From: RecastPress P0 experiment
Subject: [DRAFT] opt-in NTS fresh-WASI Zend Fiber context backend

Not built or executed. Physical guest stacks and descriptors are quarantined
until the host drops the WASIX executor and fresh instance; no free/reuse.
Apply only to wasix-org/php f4bfae79d5c19028349082f707930cf0951d23b9.

